      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I imagine if you're starting fresh completely and not slowly adding your existing friends back you may struggle to get up in rank quickly because you would be missing the common interactions that are built over time until you find new friends to repeat the requirements and built more \"trust\". \nBasically playing the game is slower when you don't have others to consistently interact with, or have any popular worlds/avatars for people to interact with.\nNobody who does know what the requirements are will ever reveal them though, so good luck.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
