      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "cheapening the rankings that much would cause a lot of undesired effects. I know I would never be able to trust someone based on rank alone again as 55 hours is easily achievable in a week by someone bored/on vacation. people would start having to ramp up their safety settings to only show friends. the trust system would be truly a joke at that point.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
