  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-08T18:29:48.503Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I started a new account since I wanted a fresh start and have heard the horror stories of how long it takes to get out of the visitor rank. I think it should be fixed.\nVisitor rank - Achieved by logging in for the first time. Must spend 5 hours not AFK exploring worlds, adding a few friends, and not being kicked or muted excessively.\nNew User rank - Spend 10 hours not AFK, exploring worlds, adding more friends, no toxic behavior like being kicked or muted excessively and uploading avatars and worlds can shorten the amount of time to get to Known User.\nUser rank - Spend 15 hours not AFK, going to different worlds, adding more friends and maintain a good behavior.\nKnown User rank - Must spend 25 hours doing the same things as other ranks and must upload avatars and worlds to get to \"Trusted\"\nTrusted User rank - Final rank, requires about 55 hours to obtain.",
